\ Supervision: RESTARTING runs a loop again whenever it ends; SPAWN stops at MAX-WORKERS
variable tries
: flaky ( -- ) 200 ms  1 tries +!  tries @ 3 < if -4 throw then  begin 100 ms again ;
task flake  ' flaky ' restarting flake start-with
3000 ms tries @ . restarts @ .
: idle ( x -- ) drop begin stop again ;
workers @ 2 + max-workers !
: fill ( -- n code ) 0 begin 0 ['] idle ['] spawn catch ?dup 0= while drop 1+ repeat >r 2drop r> ;
fill . .
64 max-workers !  0 ' idle spawn drop  workers @ max-workers @ < .
